  18:SensorDrivers/Src/MQ4.c **** /*
  19:SensorDrivers/Src/MQ4.c ****  * 	Equation derived from the graph  in datasheet using linear fit :
  20:SensorDrivers/Src/MQ4.c ****  * 	https://www.winsen-sensor.com/d/files/MQ-4.pdf
  21:SensorDrivers/Src/MQ4.c ****  *
  22:SensorDrivers/Src/MQ4.c ****  *  log(RS/R0) = -0.5991 log(ppm) + 0.8316
  23:SensorDrivers/Src/MQ4.c ****  *  log(ppm) = (log(RS/R0) - 0.8316) / -0.5991 = (0.8316 - log(RS/R0)) / 0.5991
  24:SensorDrivers/Src/MQ4.c ****  *  ppm = pow(10,  (0.8316 - log(RS/R0)) / 0.5991)
  25:SensorDrivers/Src/MQ4.c ****  *
  26:SensorDrivers/Src/MQ4.c ****  */
